<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">Meitei: Roman Script 1st Translation</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOHN-NA I-ba Ahanba Chithi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 John</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOHN-NA</para>
  <para style="mt2">I-ba Ahanba Chithi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Wahoudok</para>
  <para style="im">Ahanba John hairiba chithi asi Christtana pokpa matung chahi 50 dagi 100 phaobagi manungda Pakhonchatpa John-na i-rambani. John-na chithi asigi a-iba adu mahakni haina sak taklamde adubu chithi asigi ahanba pandupta mahak Jisuna hinglamba amadi sibadagi hinggatpa adu mitna uhouba misak amani haina utli (1:1-3). I John-da i-ba mawong asiga John-na i-ba Aphaba Pao adugi i-ba mawong adugasu yamna manei. John-na i-ba Aphaba Pao aduga chithi ahum haibadi 1 John, 2 John amadi 3 John hairibasing asi John-na Ephesus-ta leiringeida i-bani haina thajanei.</para>
  <para style="ip">John-na chithi asi Christian pumnamakta i-bani, matam aduda “Gnostic” kouba mioi kangbu amana maram oiduna singlupna khudong chadaba thengnariba matamni. Mioising asina Jisudi mapung phana Tengban Mapu oibani adubu ee-tonggi hakchang panba tasengba mioiba ama natte haina thajarammi. Masigi maramgidamak Jisuna hingba uhouba amadi mahakki makhutmakna soklaba (1:1-3) adugi maramda John-na i-bani. Chithi asi, mahakki haraoba mapung phahannaba (1 John 1:4) thajabasingna pap touba thingnanaba (1 John 2:1) thajabasingbu aranba tambibadagi ngakthoknaba (1 John 2:26) amasung thajaba makhoising adu kanbiba phangle haibasi soidrabani hainanaba John-na i-bani (5:13).</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaopham Takpa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Chithi asibu masak takpa amadi masi i-bagi maram ama piba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Tengban Mapudi mangalni amadi Jisuna hinglamba matougumna eikhoinasu hinggadabani haiba adu sugaina takpa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 1:5-3:10">1:5–3:10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Amaga amaga nungsinou haiba yathang adu mahakna eikhoida ningsingba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 3:11-5:12">3:11–5:12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Mahakki chithi adu loisinba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1JN 5:13-21">5:13-21</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Hingbagi wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:1">Jn 1:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ahoubadagi leiraklaba, hingbagi Wa adugi maramda nakhoida eikhoina i-ri. Eikhoina madu tare, eikhoigi imitna ure; hoi, eikhoina ujare amasung eikhoigi khutna madu sokle. <verse eid="1JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Jn 1:14</ref></char></note>Hingba adu uhanbire; eikhoina madu ujare amadi madugi maramda eikhoina sakhi pi amasung eikhoida uhanbiba amadi Mapa Ibungoga leiminnaramba lomba naidaba hingba adu eikhoina nakhoida laothok-i. <verse eid="1JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3"/>Nakhoisu eikhoiga tinanaba eikhoina uraba amadi taraba adu nakhoida laothok-i. Eikhoigi tinnaba adudi Mapaga amadi mahakki Machanupa, Jisu Christtagani. <verse eid="1JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4"/>Eikhoigi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ariba lairik kharadadi “Nakhoigi” haina yao-i</char></note> haraoba mapung phahannaba eikhoina masi ijabani.<verse eid="1JN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapudi mangalni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5"/>Eikhoina mahakki Machanupadagi taraba amadi nakhoigi naphamda laothoklaba paojel adu asini: Tengban Mapudi mangalni, aduga mangonda amamba amata leite. <verse eid="1JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6"/>Eikhoina Ibungo mahakka tinajei hairaga amambada hinglabadi, eikhoina wahei amadi thabak animakta minamle. <verse eid="1JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7"/>Adubu mahakna mangalda leibagumna eikhoinasu mangalda leirabadi, eikhoi amaga amaga tinnaba phangle, aduga mahakki Machanupa Jisugi eena eikhoibu pap pumnamaktagi sengdokpi.<verse eid="1JN 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8"/>Eikhoina eikhoida pap leite hairabadi, eikhoi isa ithanta minamjare amasung achumba adu eikhoida leite. <verse eid="1JN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9"/>Adubu eikhoina eikhoigi papsing Tengban Mapuda haidokcharabadi, mahakna mahakki wasak adu ngakkani amadi achumba adu tougani: Ibungo mahakna eikhoigi papsing kokpigani amasung aranba touba pumnamaktagi sengdokpigani. <verse eid="1JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10"/>Eikhoina pap toude hairabadi, eikhoina Ibungo mahakpu minamba oihalle, amasung mahakki wa eikhoida leite.<verse eid="1JN 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Eikhoibu tengbangbiba Christta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1"/>Eigi nungsiraba angangsa, nakhoina pap toudanaba, eina waramsing asi nakhoigi naphamda i-ri; kanagumbana pap tourabadi, Ipagi maphamda eikhoigidamak wanombiba eikhoigi kanagumba ama leiri, mahak adudi achumba chatpa Jisu Christtani. <verse eid="1JN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2"/>Ibungo mahakti eikhoigi papki katthokpiraba usin aduni aduga eikhoigita nattana taibangpan pumbagi papkidaksuni.<verse eid="1JN 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3"/>Eikhoina mahakki yathangsing ngaklabadi eikhoina mahakpu khang-i haiba eikhoina khang-i. <verse eid="1JN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4"/>Kanagumbana “Eina mahakpu khang-i” hairaga mahakki yathangsing indrabadi mahak minambani, aduga achumba adu mangonda leite. <verse eid="1JN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5"/>Adubu kanagumba amana mahakki wa illabadi Tengban Mapubu nungsiba adu makhoida tasengna mapung phaba oihalle. Eikhoina Ibungoda lei haibasi masina sengna khangba ngammi: <verse eid="1JN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6"/>Tengban Mapuda lei hairiba mahak aduna Jisuna hinglamba adugumna mahakna hingba tai.<verse eid="1JN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anouba Yathang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Achanbasa, eina nakhoida anouba yathang ama i-ba natte adubu ahoubadagi nakhoida leiraklaba ariba aduni. Ariba yathang asi nakhoina hannana taraba paojel aduni. <verse eid="1JN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8"/>Adum oinamak, eina nakhoida anouba yathang ama i-ri, maramdi masigi achumba asi Christtada u-i amasung nakhoidasu u-i. Maramdi amamba adu houkhre amasung achumba mangal adu nganduna leire.<verse eid="1JN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9"/>Kanagumbana mahak mangalda lei hairaga mahakki machin manaobu tukkacharabadi, mahak houjiksu amambada leiri. <verse eid="1JN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10"/>Machin manaobu nungsiba mahak adu mangalda lei amasung mangonda khudi thiningai kari amata leite. <verse eid="1JN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11"/>Adubu kanagumba amana machin manaobu tukkacharabadi mahak amambada lei amadi mahakna amambada koichat chatli. Amambana mahakpu mamit tanghanba maramna mahakna kadaida chatlibano haiba khangde.<verse eid="1JN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12"/>Eigi nungsiraba angangsa, Christtagi maramgidamak nakhoigi papsing kokpikhraba maramna eina nakhoida i-ri. <verse eid="1JN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13"/>Mapa oibasa, ahoubadagi leiraklaba mahakpu nakhoina khangbagi maramna eina nakhoida i-ri. Naha oibasa, nakhoina Phattaba Mahak adubu ngambagi maramna eina nakhoida i-ri.<verse eid="1JN 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14"/>Nungsiraba angangsa, nakhoina Ipa adubu khangbagi maramna eina nakhoida i-ri. Mapa oibasa, ahoubadagi leiraklaba mahakpu nakhoina khangbagi maramna eina nakhoida i-ri. Naha oibasa, nakhoi panggal kalli, amadi Tengban Mapugi wa adu nakhoida lei, amasung nakhoina Phattaba Mahak adubu ngambagi maramna eina nakhoida i-ri.<verse eid="1JN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15"/>Taibangpan nattraga taibangpanda leiriba pot amatabu nungsiganu. Kanagumba mi amana taibangpanbu nungsirabadi, Ipabu nungsiba adu mangonda leite. <verse eid="1JN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16"/>Taibangpanda leiriba pumnamak haibadi hakchanggi apamba, mitki apamba amasung punsigi napal asising asi Ipadagi lakpa natte, adubu taibangpandagini. <verse eid="1JN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17"/>Taibangpan amasung masigi apamba adu mangsillakli; adubu Tengban Mapugi aningba touba mahak adudi matam pumnamakta hingduna lei.<verse eid="1JN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christtagi Yeknaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18"/>Eigi nungsiraba angangsa, aroiba pungjani; Christtagi maiyokta leiba mahak adu lakkani haiba nakhoina takhibagumna, houjiksu Christtagi yeknaba mayam ama thorakle. Maram aduna aroiba pungjani haiba eikhoina khangle. <verse eid="1JN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19"/>Makhoina eikhoidagi chatthokkhibani adubu tasengbadi makhoi eikhoigi oiramde, maramdi makhoi eikhoigi oiramlabadi, makhoi eikhoiga adum leiramgadabani, adubu makhoina chatthokkhiba aduna makhoi amata eikhoigi natte haibadu phongdokle.<verse eid="1JN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20"/>Adubu nakhoidi Christtana nakhoigi nathakta Thawai Asengba heithabikhrabani, maram aduna nakhoi pumnamak achumba adu khang-i. <verse eid="1JN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21"/>Nakhoina achumba adu khangdabagi maramna eina nakhoida i-ba natte, adubu nakhoina achumba adu khangbagi maramna amasung achumba adudagi minamba amata laktaba maramna i-bani.<verse eid="1JN 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22"/>Adunadi minamba ngangba adu kanano? Jisubu Christtani haiba yadaba mahak aduni. Mahak adudi Mapa amasung Machanupabu yadaba Christtagi yeknaba mini. <verse eid="1JN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23"/>Machanupa adubu yadaba mi khudingmak Mapa adubusu yadabani; Machanupa adubu yaba mi khudingmak Mapa adubusu phang-i.<verse eid="1JN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24"/>Nakhoigidamakti, nakhoina ahoubadagi takhraba adu nakhoida lengdana leihallu. Madu nakhoina tourabadi, nakhoisu Machanupada amasung Mapada lengdana leigani. <verse eid="1JN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25"/>Christtana eikhoida pibigani wasakpikhiba adu asini madudi lomba naidaba hingba aduni.<verse eid="1JN 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26"/>Nakhoibu lanna lamjingnaba hotnariba makhoising adugi maramda eina nakhoida waramsing asi i-bani. <verse eid="1JN 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27"/>Nakhoigidamakti, nakhoina Ibungo mangondagi phangkhraba thao noibiraba adu nakhoida lengdana lei, aduna nakhoibu kanagumbana tambibagi mathou tade. Adubu Ibungogi thao noibiba aduna nakhoibu hiram pumnamakki maramda tambi aduga thao noibiba adu thanggeisengbani, sasinnaba minamba natte. Nakhoibu tambikhraba adugumna nakhoi Ibungoda lengdana leiyu.<verse eid="1JN 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28"/>Aduna houjikti, eigi nungsiraba angangsa, Ibungona lenglakpa matamda mahakki mangda eikhoina ikaiba leitanaba amasung thouna leinaba Ibungoda lengdana leiyu. <verse eid="1JN 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29"/>Christtadi achumba chatpani haiba nakhoina khanglabadi, achumba touba khudingmak Ibungodagi pokpani haiba nakhoina khang-i.<verse eid="1JN 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapugi machasing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:12">Jn 1:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yeng-u, eikhoibu Tengban Mapugi machasing koubinaba Ipana eikhoigi ithakta kayagi matik nungsibire! Madumak eikhoi oiribani! Taibangpanna eikhoibu khangdabagi maramdi taibangpanna Ibungo mahakpu khangde. <verse eid="1JN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2"/>Achanbasa, houjik eikhoi Tengban Mapugi machasingni aduga eikhoi kari oigadage haiba houjik phaoba phongdokpidri. Adubu Christtabu phongdokpiba matamda eikhoi mahak man-gani maramdi mahakna oiribagumna eikhoina mahakpu ugani haiba eikhoina khang-i. <verse eid="1JN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3"/>Christtada asa asi leiba mi khudingmakna, Ibungona sengba oibagumna makhoi masabu sengdokchei.<verse eid="1JN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4"/>Pap touba mi khudingna wayel yathangbu thugai; tasengna hairabada, papti wayel yathang thugaibani. <verse eid="1JN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:29">Jn 1:29</ref></char></note>Adubu Christtana eikhoigi pap louthokpinaba Ibungo mahak phongdokpire haiba nakhoina khang-i. Ibungoda pap amata leite. <verse eid="1JN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6"/>Ibungonda leiba mi amatana pap touduna leite. Pap touduna leiriba mi amatana Ibungo mahakpu usu-udri amasung khangsu-khangdri.<verse eid="1JN 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7"/>Eigi nungsiraba angangsa, mi kana amatana nakhoibu lanna lamjing-han-ganu. Ibungona achumba chatpagumna achumba touriba mahak adu achumba chatpani. <verse eid="1JN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8"/>Papki thabak touriba mahak adu Devil-dagini, maramdi Devil-di ahoubadagi houna pap tourakli. Tengban Mapugi machanupa adubu phongdokpibagi maramdi Devil-gi thabak manghannabani.<verse eid="1JN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9"/>Tengban Mapudagi poklaba kana amatana pap touduna leiroi, maramdi Tengban Mapugi maru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tengban Mapugi mahousa oiba adumak</char></note> adu makhoida lei; makhoina pap makha tana touduna leiba ngamde, maramdi makhoi Tengban Mapudagi poklabani. <verse eid="1JN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10"/>Matou asumna Tengban Mapugi machasing adu kanano amasung Devil-gi machasing adu kanano haiba eikhoina khang-i: achumba toudaba mahak adu Tengban Mapugi macha natte aduga machin manaobu nungsidaba mahak adusu natte.<verse eid="1JN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amaga amaga nungsinou</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nakhoina ahoubadagi taraba paojel adu asini: Eikhoi amaga amaga nungsinagadabani. <verse eid="1JN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Meihou 4:8</ref></char></note>Phattaba Mahak adugi oiduna Cain-na manao nupa Abel-bu hatpagumna eikhoi oiroidabani. Karigidamak mahakna manao nupabu hatkhibano? Maramdi mahakna toubasing adu aranba oirammi adubu mahakki manao nupana toubasing adu achumba oirammi.<verse eid="1JN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13"/>Eigi ichil inaosa, taibangpanna nakhoibu tukkacharabadi maduda ngakkanu. <verse eid="1JN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:24">Jn 5:24</ref></char></note>Eikhoidi sibadagi hingbada lanthokle haiba eikhoina khang-i, maramdi eikhoi amaga amaga nungsinei. Nungsidaba mahak adu sibada leiri. <verse eid="1JN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15"/>Machin manaobu tukkachaba mahak adu mihatpani, mihatpa mi amatada lomba naidaba hingba leite haiba nakhoina khang-i. <verse eid="1JN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16"/>Matou asumna nungsiba asi karino haiba eikhoina khang-i: Jisu Christtana eikhoigidamak mahakki thawai katthokpi. Madu oirabadi, eikhoinasu ichil inaosinggidamak eikhoigi thawai katthokpham thok-i. <verse eid="1JN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17"/>Lan thum leiba kanagumba amana mahakki machin manaosinggi awatpa adu uraga makhoigidamak mangonda nungsibiba leitrabadi, karamna Tengban Mapugi nungsiba adu mangonda leibage? <verse eid="1JN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18"/>Eigi nungsiraba angangsa, eikhoina waheitana nattraga ngangbatana nungsigumsi, adubu thabakna amasung achumbana nungsisi.<verse eid="1JN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapugi mangda thouna phaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19"/>Matou asumna eikhoi achumba adugini haiba khang-i amasung eikhoigi thammoibu Ibungogi mangda langtaknaba yaodana eikhoibu leihalli. <verse eid="1JN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20"/>Eikhoigi thammoina eikhoibu lalhallabadi, Tengban Mapuna eikhoigi thammoidagi henna chao-i amasung Ibungona pumnamak khangbi haiba eikhoina khang-i. <verse eid="1JN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21"/>Achanbasa, eikhoigi thammoina eikhoibu lalhandrabadi, Tengban Mapugi mangda eikhoigi thouna phaba lei. <verse eid="1JN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22"/>Eikhoina Ibungo mahakki yathang ngakpa amasung mahakki apenba adu touba maramna eikhoigi nijaba makhei eikhoina mangondagi phangjei. <verse eid="1JN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:12">15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref></char></note>Mahakki yathang adudi: mahakki Machanupa Jisu Christtagi mingda thajaba amasung Christtana eikhoida yathang pibagumna eikhoi amaga amaga nungsinaba aduni. <verse eid="1JN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24"/>Tengban Mapugi yathang ngakpa mahak adu Ibungo mangonda lei amasung Ibungo mahakna mangonda lei. Tengban Mapuna eikhoida pibiba Thawai adugi mapanna Tengban Mapuna eikhoida lei haiba eikhoina khang-i.<verse eid="1JN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Achumba Thawai amasung chumdaba thawai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1"/>Achanbasa, thawai khudingmak thajaganu, adubu thawaising adu Tengban Mapudagi lakpra haiba khangnaba chang yeng-u, maramdi wa phongdoksinnaba yamna taibangpanda chatthokkhre. <verse eid="1JN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2"/>Masidagi nakhoina Tengban Mapugi Thawai adu khanggani: Jisu Christtana hakchang oina lakle haiba adu chummi haina yajaba thawai khuding adu Tengban Mapudagini. <verse eid="1JN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3"/>Adubu Jisubu hakchang oina lakle haiba adu yadaba thawai khudingmak Tengban Mapudagi natte. Madu nakhoina lakkani haina taba Christtabu Yeknaba adugi thawaini aduga houjikmak mahak taibangpan asida leirabani.<verse eid="1JN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4"/>Eigi nungsiraba angangsa, nakhoidi Tengban Mapudagini, aduga nakhoina makhoibu ngamle, maramdi taibangpanda leiba mahak adudagi nakhoigi nungda leiba mahakna henna chao-i. <verse eid="1JN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5"/>Wa phongdoksinnaba makhoising adu taibangpanbadagini maram aduna makhoina taibangpan-gi oiba maramda ngang-i aduga taibangpanna makhoina haiba adu tai. <verse eid="1JN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6"/>Eikhoi Tengban Mapugini, Tengaban Mapubu khangba misingna eikhoigi wa tai adubu Tengban Mapugi nattaba misingna eikhoigi wa tade. Masidagi eikhoina achumbagi Thawai amasung aranbagi thawai adu khang-i.<verse eid="1JN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapudi nungsibani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7"/>Achanbasa, eikhoi amaga amaga nungsinasi, maramdi nungsibasi Tengban Mapudagi lakpani. Nungsiba mi khudingmak Tengban Mapudagi pokpani amasung Tengban Mapubu khang-i. <verse eid="1JN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8"/>Nungsidaba mahak aduna Tengban Mapubu khangde; maramdi Tengban Mapudi nungsibani. <verse eid="1JN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9"/>Tengban Mapuna eikhoibu nungsibiba adu asumna utpire madudi mahakna mahakki amatta ngairaba Machanupabu taibangpanda thabire, masi eikhoina mahakki mapanna hingnanabani. <verse eid="1JN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10"/>Masini nungsiba haiba adu: eikhoina Tengban Mapubu nungsire haiba natte, adubu Tengban Mapuna eikhoibu nungsibiraduna eikhoigi papkidamak usin-gi irapot oinaba mahakki Machanupabu thabire.<verse eid="1JN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11"/>Achanbasa, Tengban Mapuna eikhoibu asuk nungsibirabadi, eikhoinasu amaga amaga nungsinapham thok-i. <verse eid="1JN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:18">Jn 1:18</ref></char></note>Mi kana amatana Tengban Mapubu ukhidri adubu eikhoina amaga amaga nungsinarabadi, Tengban Mapuna eikhoida lei aduga mahakki nungsiba adu eikhoida mapung phaba oihalle.<verse eid="1JN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13"/>Ibungona eikhoida mahakki Thawai pibiba maramna eikhoina Ibungonda lei amasung Ibungona eikhoida lei haiba eikhoina khang-i. <verse eid="1JN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14"/>Mapa aduna mahakki Machanupa adubu taibangpanbagi Kanbiba Mapu oinaba thabirakle haiba adu eikhoina ure amasung eikhoina sakhi pi. <verse eid="1JN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15"/>Jisudi Tengban Mapugi Machanupani haiba adu achumbani haina yajaba mi aduda Tengban Mapuna lei amasung mahakna Tengban Mapuda lei. <verse eid="1JN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16"/>Tengban Mapuna eikhoibu nungsibiba adu eikhoina khangle amasung thajare.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1JN 4:16">Tengban Mapudi nungsibani. Kanagumbana nungsibada leirabadi mahak Tengban Mapuda leirabani amasung Tengban Mapuna mangonda lei. <verse eid="1JN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17"/>Wayen-gi numitta thouna phana eikhoina leiba yananaba eikhoigi irakta nungsiba adu asumna mapung phahanbire: Taibangpan asida eikhoi Christtagumna oiribani. <verse eid="1JN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18"/>Nungsibada akiba leite. Adubu mapung phaba nungsibana akiba tanthok-i, maramdi akibadi cheirak phangbaga mari leinei. Akiba mahak adu nungsibada mapung phade.<verse eid="1JN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19"/>Eikhoina nungsi maramdi Tengban Mapuna eikhoibu hanna nungsibire. <verse eid="1JN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20"/>Kanagumba mi amana Tengban Mapubu nungsi hairaga machin manaobu tukkacharabadi, mahak chinthibani. Maramdi uraba machin manaobu nungsidaba mahak aduna udriba Tengban Mapubu nungsiba ngamloi. <verse eid="1JN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21"/>Ibungona eikhoida yathang asi pibire: Tengban Mapubu nungsiba mahak aduna mahakki machin manaobusu nungsigadabani.<verse eid="1JN 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Thajabana taibangpanbabu ngamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1"/>Jisudi Christtani haina thajaba mi khudingmak Tengban Mapudagi poklabani aduga mapa adubu nungsiba mi khudingna machabusu nungsi. <verse eid="1JN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2"/>Eikhoina Tengban Mapubu nungsiba amasung mahakki yathangsing adu ngakllabadi eikhoina Tengban Mapugi machasingbu nungsi haiba khang-i. <verse eid="1JN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:15">Jn 14:15</ref></char></note>Eikhoina Tengban Mapubu nungsiba haibasi mahakki yathangsing inba aduni. Mahakki yathangsingdi eikhoigidamak potlum natte, <verse eid="1JN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4"/>maramdi Tengban Mapudagi poklaba mi khudingna taibangpanbabu ngammi. Eikhoina taibangpanbabu ngamba haibasi eikhoigi thajabagi mapannani. <verse eid="1JN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5"/>Taibangpanbabu ngamba mahak adu kanano? Jisudi Tengban Mapugi Machanupani haina thajaba mahak adu khaktanani.<verse eid="1JN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Christtagi maramda sakhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6"/>Ising amasung eegi mapanna lenglakpa Ibungo mahak adu asini, haibadi Jisu Christtani. Mahakna isingtagi mapanna lakpa natte adubu ising amasung eegi mapannani. Sakhi piriba adu Thawai adunani maramdi Thawai adu achumbani. <verse eid="1JN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7"/>Sakhi ahum lei: <verse eid="1JN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8"/>Thawai, ising amasung eeni; ahum asi amata oina yanei. <verse eid="1JN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9"/>Eikhoina mioibagi sakhi lou-i adubu Tengban Mapugi sakhina henna chao-i maramdi mahakki Machanupagi maramda sakhi piriba asi Tengban Mapugi sakhini. <verse eid="1JN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10"/>Tengban Mapugi Machanupa adubu thajaba makhoina sakhi asi lou-i. Tengban Mapubu thajadaba makhoina Tengban Mapubu chinthiba oihalli, maramdi Tengban Mapuna Machanupagi maramda sakhi piba adu makhoina thajade. <verse eid="1JN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:36">Jn 3:36</ref></char></note> Sakhi adu asini, Tengban Mapuna eikhoida lomba naidaba hingba pibire, aduga hingba adu mahakki Machanupa aduda lei. <verse eid="1JN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12"/>Machanupa adubu phanglaba mahak aduna hingba adu phangle; Tengban Mapugi Machanupa adubu phangdaba mahak aduna hingba adu phangde.<verse eid="1JN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lomba naidaba hingba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13"/>Tengban Mapugi Machanupagi mingda thajaba nakhoida lomba naidaba hingba lei haibasi nakhoina khangnanaba waramsing asi eina nakhoida i-bani. <verse eid="1JN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14"/>Tengban Mapugi maphamda changjabada eikhoigi leijaba chetna thajaba adu asini: madudi eikhoina mahakki ningba matung inna karigumba ama eikhoina nijarabadi, mahakna eikhoigi nijaba adu tabi. <verse eid="1JN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15"/>Eikhoina nijaba makhei Ibungona tabi haiba eikhoina khanglabadi, eikhoina mahakki maphamdagi nijakhiba adu eikhoina phangle haiba khang-i.<verse eid="1JN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16"/>Kanagumba nahakki machin manao amana siba thok-hanba nattaba pap touba urabadi, nahakna haijabigadabani aduga Tengban Mapuna makhoida hingba pibigani. Eina hairiba asi siba thok-hanba nattaba pap toubasing makhoi adugini. Siba thok-hanba pap lei. Nakhoina madugi maramda haijagadabani haina eina haiba natte. <verse eid="1JN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17"/>Aranba touba pumnamak papni adubu siba thok-handaba pap lei.<verse eid="1JN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18"/>Tengban Mapudagi pokkhraba mi kana amatana pap makha tana touduna leite haiba eikhoina khang-i; Tengban Mapugi Machanupa aduna makhoibu ngaksenbi amasung Phattaba Mahak aduna makhoibu sokpa ngamde.<verse eid="1JN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19"/>Eikhoidi Tengban Mapugi machasingni aduga taibangpan pumbadi Phattaba Mahak adugi makhutta lei haiba eikhoina khang-i.<verse eid="1JN 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20"/>Eikhoina achumba Tengban Mapu adubu khangnanaba Tengban Mapugi Machanupa adu lengbiraktuna eikhoida wakhal taba pibire haibasu eikhoina khang-i. Tengban Mapugi Machanupa Jisu Christtada leijaduna eikhoina Tengban Mapuda lei.<verse eid="1JN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21"/>Eigi nungsiba angangsa, nakhoi nasabu lai-murtisingdagi lapna leiyu.<verse eid="1JN 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5"/>
</usx>
